^{:go/end 268} (go/method op3 "op3 emits a 3-operand instruction op src1, src2, dst,\ntaking care to handle 2-operand machines and also\nto simplify the printout when src2==dst.\n" [^{:tag (* Asm)} a ^string op ^Reg src1 ^Reg src2 ^Reg dst]
